<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cdefect</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cdefect now
</pre>
<p>Takes you out of your clan, of your own free will. To make sure you mean 
it, you must type the word now after it: cdefect alone only tells you how.
</p><p>When you leave, your title becomes "Clan Defector", and your hometown goes 
back to the temple of Udgaard. The clan's tattoo stays on your skin. If you 
change your mind, only a clan Master, Lord or member of rank 10 can take 
you back in (see <a cmd='#'>Help Caccept</a>).
</p><p>A clan Master can't defect: first hand the clan over to someone else, with 
cappoint &lt;member&gt; master (see <a cmd='#'>Help Cappoint</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Caccept</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cremove</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>